      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like the emptiness you feel is a reflection of the immense pain being inflicted upon your sense of self by the outside world. When everything feels like a performance and the stage lights are harsh, that urge to simply stop is a terrifyingly understandable response. If the weight of existing feels too heavy, please consider letting the void be a gentle place to rest, not a final destination. If you are in crisis, please reach out to the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline immediately.",
